{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aetherion is an atmospheric 2D action-adventure game with Metroidvania elements. Explore a mysterious world, face challenging boss battles, and discover how your character and the environment change over the course of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Metroidvania world: Explore the mystical world of Aetherion, as well as deeply hidden caves and ruins. Each area holds secrets, new enemies and unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss battles: Face powerful creatures that will test your skills with different attack patterns and phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting &amp; resources: Collect materials and essences to create equipment, upgrades or new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox building: Build and design your own structures - as an additional gameplay option alongside the main progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration &amp; secrets: Find hidden locations, discover shortcuts and uncover the secrets of the world of Aetherion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927380?t=1762677042","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927380?t=1762677042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927380/d1a646c4a994c577186bcc29a65cfddc97c75371/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762677042","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927380/d1a646c4a994c577186bcc29a65cfddc97c75371/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762677042","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aetherion is an atmospheric 2D action-adventure game with Metroidvania elements. Explore a mysterious world, face challenging boss battles, and discover how your character and the environment change over the course of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Metroidvania world: Explore the mystical world of Aetherion, as well as deeply hidden caves and ruins. Each area holds secrets, new enemies and unique mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss battles: Face powerful creatures that will test your skills with different attack patterns and phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting &amp; resources: Collect materials and essences to create equipment, upgrades or new possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox building: Build and design your own structures - as an additional gameplay option alongside the main progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration &amp; secrets: Find hidden locations, discover shortcuts and uncover the secrets of the world of Aetherion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["AiirolDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927380/2047a749cde6852fcc0025227b085781ec486a68/header.jpg?t=1762677042","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Aethe